  - m_Id: 39858674068512801
    m_Key: l1e7 63
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39858674068512802
    m_Key: l1e7 64
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39858674068512803
    m_Key: l1e7 65
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39858674068512804
    m_Key: l1e7 66
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39858674068512805
    m_Key: l1e7 67
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39858674068512806
    m_Key: l1e7 68
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39858674068512807
    m_Key: l1e7 69
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39858674068512808
    m_Key: l1e7 70
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39858674068512809
    m_Key: l1e7 71
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39858674068512810
    m_Key: l1e7 72
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39858674068512811
    m_Key: l1e7 73
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39858674068512812
    m_Key: l1e7 74
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39858674068512813
    m_Key: l1e7 75
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39858674068512814
    m_Key: l1e7 76
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39858674072707072
    m_Key: l1e7 77
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39858674072707073
    m_Key: l1e7 78
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39858674072707074
    m_Key: l1e7 79
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39858674072707075
    m_Key: l1e7 80
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39858674072707076
    m_Key: l1e7 81
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39858674072707077
    m_Key: l1e7 82
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39858674072707078
    m_Key: l1e7 83
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39858674072707079
    m_Key: l1e7 84
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39858674072707080
    m_Key: l1e7 85
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39858674072707081
    m_Key: l1e7 86
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39858674072707082
    m_Key: l1e7 87
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39858674072707083
    m_Key: l1e7 88
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39858674072707084
    m_Key: l1e7 89
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39890501168685056
    m_Key: l1e7 90
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76866541631725568
    m_Key: Usually, I don't have to serve every single customer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76863787903377408
    m_Key: It's enough to take care of most of them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76863787903377409
    m_Key: This gizmo shows how many more customers I need to satisfy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76863787903377410
    m_Key: Oh boy.<pause:0.5> So many kids showed up that they couldn't all fit inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76863787903377411
    m_Key: Some of them are waiting for a spot to open up before they can place an
      order.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76863787903377412
    m_Key: This thing shows who's next in line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76863787903377413
    m_Key: Sometimes it helps to stall for time,<pause:0.5> but don't push it too
      far.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 76863787903377414
    m_Key: The customers in line have patience too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020216782848
    m_Key: Wow, what a trip.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948672
    m_Key: So, where are we now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948673
    m_Key: Somewhere not too far from Clifford.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948674
    m_Key: The signal's really bad out here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948675
    m_Key: So we'll have to improvise from here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948676
    m_Key: Catch another bus<pause:0.5> or ask the locals for directions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948677
    m_Key: t<volume:0>...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948678
    m_Key: t<volume:1>Though<pause:1> that might be a bit of a problem.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948679
    m_Key: Are we lost?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948680
    m_Key: Oh, don't be so dramatic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948681
    m_Key: Worst case, we wait here for the next bus and head back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948682
    m_Key: No way!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95032048352387072
    m_Key: We didn't come all the way out here just to give up now!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95027885946068992
    m_Key: Hey, where are you going?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948685
    m_Key: To find that stupid little town.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948686
    m_Key: And when I get there, I'm gonna cook an outrageous amount of spaghetti!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948687
    m_Key: And the locals are gonna have to eat every last bit of it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948688
    m_Key: And they will love it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948689
    m_Key: '!!!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95028971859763200
    m_Key: I mean, where are you going?<pause:0.75> You just walked right past a
      sign.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948691
    m_Key: Oh.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948692
    m_Key: It says Clifford's just down this trail.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948693
    m_Key: So what are we waiting for?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948694
    m_Key: Tremble, people of Clifford!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948695
    m_Key: Red is coming!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948696
    m_Key: And the great and terrible Red isn't scared of a creepy forest like this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948697
    m_Key: A little.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948698
    m_Key: But it's not as scary as turning back!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948699
    m_Key: I'm sure<pause:0.75> it's not as bad as it looks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948700
    m_Key: One last push, and we'll be relaxing in Clifford after the trip.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948701
    m_Key: And sipping cocktails with little umbrellas? (question)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948702
    m_Key: And sipping cocktails with little umbrellas.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948703
    m_Key: Sweet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948704
    m_Key: When did you change your hat?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948705
    m_Key: When our road trip turned into a hike, dummy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948706
    m_Key: Look.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948707
    m_Key: I think we made it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95060151254540288
    m_Key: No<pause:0.5>, this isn't Clifford.<pause:0.5> This is Riverside.<pause:0.5>
      See?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948709
    m_Key: Damn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948710
    m_Key: Hey,<pause:0.75> look on the bright side. At least we're not lost anymore!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948711
    m_Key: And would you look at that!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948712
    m_Key: A local!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948713
    m_Key: Hi there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948714
    m_Key: AAAH!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95060151283900416
    m_Key: That damn Clifforder brought Leshy into our village!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948716
    m_Key: We're doomed!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95060151283900417
    m_Key: Me? Leshy?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948718
    m_Key: Don't move, forest monster!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948719
    m_Key: Yeah,<pause:0.5> definitely you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948720
    m_Key: Silence, you filthy Clifforder!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948721
    m_Key: First you brought disease upon us!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95060151283900418
    m_Key: And now you've decided to sic Leshy on us!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948723
    m_Key: We won't let that happen!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948724
    m_Key: I think there's been a huge misunderstanding.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948725
    m_Key: We're not from Clifford.<pause:0.5> We were actually just about to leave.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020241948726
    m_Key: You're not getting away that easily after everything you've done!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246142976
    m_Key: Uh-oh.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246142977
    m_Key: Alright,<pause:0.5> break it up.<pause:0.5> Nothing to see here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246142978
    m_Key: These two are coming with me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246142979
    m_Key: But they're from Clifford!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246142980
    m_Key: Where they're from is none of your concern.<pause:0.75> You've still got
      plenty of work to do today!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246142981
    m_Key: All of you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246142982
    m_Key: But!..
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246142983
    m_Key: No buts!<pause:0.75> Hasn't anyone put a curse on you in a while?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246142984
    m_Key: Tch!<pause:0.5> Witch!<pause:0.5> Come on,<pause:0.5> the hag's found
      herself a new pair of toys.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246142985
    m_Key: WHO ARE YOU CALLING A HAG, YOU PEST?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246142986
    m_Key: Yikes!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246142987
    m_Key: t<volume:1>*sigh*<pause:0.75> Follow me,<pause:0.5> before they change
      their minds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246142988
    m_Key: Your place is so cozy!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246142989
    m_Key: What's all this stuff on the shelves?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246142990
    m_Key: Don't touch the antiques.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246142991
    m_Key: Wasn't planning to.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246142992
    m_Key: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246142993
    m_Key: Thank you for standing up for us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246142994
    m_Key: Yeah,<pause:0.5> if it weren't for you, they would've eaten us alive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246142995
    m_Key: '*sigh*<pause:0.5> They wouldn''t have eaten anyone,<pause:0.5> they''re
      not monsters.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246142996
    m_Key: They're just on edge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246142997
    m_Key: Most likely, they would've just chased you out of Riverside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246142998
    m_Key: Worst case, they would've shouted a few nasty things after you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246142999
    m_Key: Actually, it suits us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143000
    m_Key: We were just passing through anyway. We weren't planning to stick around
      this godforsaken...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143001
    m_Key: What a shame.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143002
    m_Key: We'd hate to leave such a lovely place in such a hurry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95336547382091776
    m_Key: Especially after accidentally upsetting the locals.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143004
    m_Key: You'd better listen to your elders, orange one.<pause:0.75> People value
      that around here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143005
    m_Key: And you shouldn't be in such a rush anyway.<pause:0.5> The road ahead
      is even tougher than the one that brought you here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143006
    m_Key: Am I right in assuming you're headed for Clifford?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143007
    m_Key: Yes, ma'am!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143008
    m_Key: Strange choice, but that's your business.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143009
    m_Key: Our cart horse already left for Clifford to pick up medicine. He won't
      be back until late tonight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143010
    m_Key: The next trip to town is tomorrow morning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143011
    m_Key: So until then, we'd better stay put and keep a low profile?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95336547411451904
    m_Key: Exactly.<pause:0.5> Unless the evil Leshy and the filthy Clifforder want
      to push the locals' patience even further.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143013
    m_Key: Perfect!<pause:0.75> Then we'll sit here quietly and stay out of everyone's
      way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143014
    m_Key: Smart little fox.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143015
    m_Key: They are waiting for medicines from the city.<pause:0.5> Are they sick?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143016
    m_Key: Yep.<pause:0.75> Those scatterbrains managed to catch some kind of illness,
      and now half the village's come down with it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143017
    m_Key: That's why they're so afraid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143018
    m_Key: They think it's some evil spirit, or the people of Clifford are behind
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143019
    m_Key: Or both.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143020
    m_Key: Actually,<pause:0.5> we could help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143021
    m_Key: Red,<pause:0.5> you've got a lot of talents,<pause:0.5> but you're not
      a doctor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143022
    m_Key: And besides, we're not exactly welcome here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143023
    m_Key: No, no, gray one.<pause:0.5> Let him finish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143024
    m_Key: So, what exactly are you proposing, orange one?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143025
    m_Key: You've got all sorts of herbs here,<pause:0.5> and I've got a whole bunch
      of cooking gear with me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143026
    m_Key: And I know the recipe for good health!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143027
    m_Key: We can make the tastiest, most healing chicken soup this village's ever
      had!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143028
    m_Key: That's...<pause:1> actually a pretty good idea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143029
    m_Key: A good bowl of soup really should help them feel better.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143030
    m_Key: I'll see if I can convince the locals to put up with you a little longer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143031
    m_Key: Well,<pause:0.5> since we're already involved, I can help with the herbs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143032
    m_Key: Do you know anything about herbs?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143033
    m_Key: Our mom's really into floristry, so she taught me a thing or two.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143034
    m_Key: I don't know what they're used for medicinally, but I do know how to gather
      them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143035
    m_Key: And I can follow instructions without getting in the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143036
    m_Key: That'll do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143037
    m_Key: And since we're working together now, and I won't be able to ignore you
      anymore, we should introduce ourselves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143038
    m_Key: Adele.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143039
    m_Key: Silver.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143040
    m_Key: Red.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143041
    m_Key: How original.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143042
    m_Key: Oh,<pause:0.5> trust me,<pause:0.5> it could've been much worse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143043
    m_Key: What was that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143044
    m_Key: Don't worry about it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143045
    m_Key: Come on, Red and Silver,<pause:0.5> we've still got plenty of work to
      do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143046
    m_Key: Alright,<pause:0.5> all our ingredients and herbs are at your disposal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143047
    m_Key: Don't make me regret this, orange one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143048
    m_Key: I've got this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143049
    m_Key: Making medicinal soup can't be that much harder than cooking regular food.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143050
    m_Key: I certainly hope you're right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143051
    m_Key: I'm about to give those germs such a beating,<pause:0.5> they won't know
      what hit 'em.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143052
    m_Key: Hey, this isn't so hard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143053
    m_Key: Don't celebrate too soon, orange one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143054
    m_Key: Everyone who's come to you so far isn't really sick yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143055
    m_Key: They're just feeling a little under the weather.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143056
    m_Key: I've brought you your first real patient.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143057
    m_Key: Send them in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143058
    m_Key: I'm<pause:0.75> not eating Leshy's poison!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143059
    m_Key: I'm not Leshy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143060
    m_Key: And I'm not listening to him either!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143061
    m_Key: '*sigh*<pause:0.75> You will if you want to get better.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143062
    m_Key: Then I choose to stay sick!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143063
    m_Key: No,<pause:0.5> you choose to get better, you<pause:0.5> ungrateful jackass.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143064
    m_Key: And that's not a request.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143065
    m_Key: Good. Then keep your mouth shut.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143066
    m_Key: Don't pay any attention to the nonsense this idiot says.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143067
    m_Key: He's been burning up with a fever since yesterday.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143068
    m_Key: And with his illness, he spoils the lives of everyone around him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143069
    m_Key: Anyone sitting next to him will be harder to cure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143070
    m_Key: Show me what you've got, orange one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143071
    m_Key: Whoa!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143072
    m_Key: Sick customers really are a pain to deal with.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143073
    m_Key: Damn,<pause:0.5> that wasn't easy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143074
    m_Key: Told you so.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143075
    m_Key: But fever's one of the easier illnesses to treat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143076
    m_Key: The mushroom mix contains rowan berries. They should help him feel better.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143077
    m_Key: Give it a try.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143078
    m_Key: Alright,<pause:0.5> I think<pause:0.5> I'm starting to get it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143079
    m_Key: Good,<pause:0.5> because I don't intend to babysit you all day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143080
    m_Key: Call me if something goes wrong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143081
    m_Key: t<volume:0>.<pause:0.5>.<pause:0.5>.<pause:0.5><volume:1> No, this is
      just ridiculous!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143082
    m_Key: I can't work under these conditions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143084
    m_Key: It's just impossible!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143083
    m_Key: This patient of yours is the most stubborn mule in the world!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143085
    m_Key: Sometimes I think he asks for anything except what he actually needs just
      to be difficult.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143086
    m_Key: Adele,<pause:0.5> I need you to yell at him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143087
    m_Key: Now that's a brilliant idea.<pause:0.5> Anything else?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143088
    m_Key: I want you to hit him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143089
    m_Key: Listen here, orange one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143090
    m_Key: Vasya is a tough nut to crack,<pause:0.5> he's not easy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143091
    m_Key: But your brother and I already have our hands full.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143092
    m_Key: We won't get very far if I have to help you with every difficult patient.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143093
    m_Key: I have my own work,<pause:0.5> and you have yours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143094
    m_Key: So go and handle it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143095
    m_Key: Hey,<pause:0.5> I'm the one saving your village from an epidemic here!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143096
    m_Key: I could've done exactly what you told me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143097
    m_Key: Sit quietly in a corner,<pause:0.5> while the locals wait for medicine
      from the city and keep getting sicker!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143098
    m_Key: t<volume:0>.<pause:0.5>.<pause:0.5>.<pause:0.5><volume:1> Alright, alright,<pause:0.5>
      you're right,<pause:0.5> I'm sorry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143099
    m_Key: But I really can't drop my work and keep running back and forth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020246143100
    m_Key: Then tell me how else I'm supposed to get through to him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337280
    m_Key: What is this old wreck?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337281
    m_Key: This is an oven.<pause:0.5> You know how to use one of these, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337282
    m_Key: Yeah, I do,<pause:0.5> but how is this supposed to help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337283
    m_Key: It has the gift of persuasion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337284
    m_Key: If someone tastes its baked goods, they'll immediately change their mind,
      no matter what the argument was about.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337285
    m_Key: What?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337286
    m_Key: If you just wanted to get rid of me, you could've said so.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337287
    m_Key: I promise it'll work.<pause:0.5> Now go,<pause:0.5> your patients are
      waiting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337288
    m_Key: Hopefully this isn't some kind of cruel joke.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337289
    m_Key: He's doing it again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337290
    m_Key: Alright,<pause:0.5> this time I'll give him a pretzel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337291
    m_Key: And he'll magically change his mind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337292
    m_Key: t<volume:0>.<pause:0.5>.<pause:0.5>.<pause:0.5><volume:1> That sounded
      so silly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337293
    m_Key: Well, I'll be damned.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337294
    m_Key: It actually works!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337295
    m_Key: Whoa.<pause:0.5> This piggy is really impatient.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337296
    m_Key: To serve him in time, I'll have to fire up the oven.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337297
    m_Key: Yeah,<pause:0.5> this should work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337298
    m_Key: With this oven, I'm not afraid of anyone!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337299
    m_Key: I'm unstoppable!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337300
    m_Key: What the heck is that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337301
    m_Key: Well,<pause:0.5> whatever all that noise is about, it's not my problem.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337302
    m_Key: Especially when I'm on a break.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337303
    m_Key: t<volume:0>.<pause:0.5>.<pause:0.5>.<pause:0.5><volume:1> Now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337304
    m_Key: Do you think this counts as a remedy?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337305
    m_Key: Probably not.<pause:0.5> It's just soup with herbs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337306
    m_Key: Yeah,<pause:0.5> but then what even counts as a remedy if not soup with
      herbs?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337307
    m_Key: Hmm,<pause:0.5> that's<pause:0.75> a very interesting observation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337308
    m_Key: The apprentice potion maker has surpassed his master!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337309
    m_Key: Focus!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337310
    m_Key: Oh, come on,<pause:0.5> it was funny!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337311
    m_Key: The kitchen is no place for fooling around!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337312
    m_Key: This is our workshop, and we're creating great things here!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337313
    m_Key: t<volume:0>.<pause:0.5>.<pause:0.5>.<pause:0.5><volume:1> It was still
      funny though.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337314
    m_Key: Fine,<pause:0.5> it was a little funny.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337315
    m_Key: A small victory!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337316
    m_Key: You're a scallywag!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337317
    m_Key: Did you hear that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337318
    m_Key: This isn't some kind of medicine for illnesses,<pause:0.5> it's just ordinary
      soup!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337319
    m_Key: Well, I don't know, Vasya.<pause:0.5> I actually feel better after eating
      his brew.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337320
    m_Key: And it's the tastiest soup I've ever had!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337321
    m_Key: Enjoy it while you can.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337322
    m_Key: It's obvious he's fattening us up so we'll taste better ourselves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337323
    m_Key: Have you completely lost your mind?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337324
    m_Key: You're seriously going to accuse Leshy of something now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337325
    m_Key: We would've kicked that Leshy out ourselves if it weren't for that damn
      witch!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337326
    m_Key: I'm not Le...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337327
    m_Key: Wait, did I just hear someone disrespect the great Leshy?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337328
    m_Key: It wasn't me!<pause:0.5> It was all him!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337329
    m_Key: Me?!<pause:0.5> I didn't do anything!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337330
    m_Key: Heheh.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337331
    m_Key: '*sigh*t'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337332
    m_Key: He broke free!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337333
    m_Key: Everyone save yourselves!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337334
    m_Key: Run for your lives!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337335
    m_Key: Oooh,<pause:0.5> how wonderful!<pause:0.5> We have guests, and you've
      all put together such a lovely little picnic!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337336
    m_Key: And nobody invited me, you rascals.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337337
    m_Key: Boris, go back home now!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337338
    m_Key: We'll bring your food to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337339
    m_Key: Go back inside?<pause:0.5> Oh, no way!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337340
    m_Key: I'm not missing all the fun with our new fluffy friends!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337341
    m_Key: Boris,<pause:0.5> I'm begging you,<pause:0.5> you'll tear this whole place
      apart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337342
    m_Key: Don't be so dramatic, Adele.<pause:0.5> I don't sneeze that hard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337343
    m_Key: I'll just sit here with you guys.<pause:0.5> I won't bother anyone!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337344
    m_Key: We get visitors so rarely!<pause:0.5> There's no way I'm missing this!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337345
    m_Key: Listen carefully, Red.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337346
    m_Key: Do whatever it takes,<pause:0.5> but don't let him sneeze.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337347
    m_Key: If he does too hard, we have to rebuild this place from the ruins!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337348
    m_Key: I won't let you down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95020020250337349
    m_Key: The Hippopotamus Oath.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95703245004103680
    m_Key: Ohhh,<pause:0.5> thank you, everyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95703245033463808
    m_Key: I haven't had such a good time in a long time!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95703245033463809
    m_Key: These past few days, everyone has been so busy and worried that I almost
      forgot what it felt like.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95703245033463810
    m_Key: And now we're all sitting at the same table again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95703245033463811
    m_Key: Sharing delicious food and stories!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95703245033463812
    m_Key: And look at me!<pause:0.5> I can already feel that I'm doing so much better!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95703245033463813
    m_Key: All of us!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95703245033463814
    m_Key: It's all thanks to you guys!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95708385291427840
    m_Key: Hooray for Aunty Adele,<pause:0.5> the Clifforder, and Leshy!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95703245033463816
    m_Key: Hooray for Leshy the doctor!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95703245033463817
    m_Key: Come on, Vasya,<pause:0.5> you know what you're supposed to say!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95707377475674112
    m_Key: t<volume:1>Hooray.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95703245033463819
    m_Key: And now come here, I'll give you all a hug!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95703245033463820
    m_Key: Boris, what are you doing?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95703245033463821
    m_Key: No matter how kind Leshy has been today, he's still a forest monster!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95703245033463822
    m_Key: He'll eat you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95711446944604160
    m_Key: I don't care, even if he were the devil himself!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95703245033463824
    m_Key: He helped my friends, and I'm going to hug him no matter what!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95703245033463825
    m_Key: Boris,<pause:0.5> be reasonable,<pause:0.5> don't.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95703245033463826
    m_Key: Feeling better doesn't mean you've fully recovered yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95703245033463827
    m_Key: Oh, stop putting on a show, you scaredy-cat!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95703245033463828
    m_Key: I'm coming!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95703245033463829
    m_Key: Wait a second!<pause:0.5> So he's not Leshy at all!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95703245033463830
    m_Key: He's just a grumpy little fox!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95703245033463831
    m_Key: Oh my gosh!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95703245033463832
    m_Key: Why didn't you tell me you weren't Leshy?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95703245033463834
    m_Key: I hope you're proud of yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95703245033463835
    m_Key: Of course.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95703245033463836
    m_Key: Enough bickering, little foxes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95703245033463837
    m_Key: Come on, let's discuss what we're going to do with you next.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96177215478325248
    m_Key: "Oh... (\u0412\u043E \u0434\u0435\u043B\u0430.)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95712882495479808
    m_Key: Clifford
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95711446944604161
    m_Key: t<volume:0>.<pause:0.5>.<pause:0.5>.<pause:0.5><volume:1> I'm going to
      burst with indignation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734023884800
    m_Key: Hiii there, little foxy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734023884801
    m_Key: Hi there, horsie.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734023884802
    m_Key: Heading off to make it big in the big city, huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734023884803
    m_Key: Not really,<pause:0.5> quite the opposite.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734028079104
    m_Key: We got so tired of making it big in the city that we decided to start
      somewhere smaller.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734028079105
    m_Key: Clifford?<pause:0.5> Small?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734028079106
    m_Key: Yeah,<pause:0.5> always has been.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95703245033463838
    m_Key: Oh...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734028079107
    m_Key: I always thought it was huge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734032273408
    m_Key: Silver said Clifford's about the size of a single district in Metropolis.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734032273409
    m_Key: Wow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734032273410
    m_Key: I've always wanted to get there,<pause:0.5> to see a big city.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734032273411
    m_Key: I knew it wasn't the biggest one out there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187968
    m_Key: But I was sure it had to be at least in the top ten.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187969
    m_Key: And now you're telling me this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187970
    m_Key: That's actually kind of disappointing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187971
    m_Key: So why don't you go?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187972
    m_Key: I can't,<pause:0.5> I'm still too little.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187973
    m_Key: Just look at yourself!<pause:0.5> You're big and strong!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187974
    m_Key: You're pulling me, my brother, and this whole cart all by yourself!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187975
    m_Key: Nooo,<pause:0.5> I mean I'm not old enough yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187976
    m_Key: Have you ever tried asking someone older to take you into town?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187977
    m_Key: I can't.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187978
    m_Key: My dad takes people to Clifford and back every day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187979
    m_Key: Some of us live here but work in the city,<pause:0.5> like Auntie Adele.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187980
    m_Key: And I'm supposed to stay in the village just in case.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187981
    m_Key: While Dad's away, I'm the only one who knows how to handle the cart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187982
    m_Key: He's always telling me to forget about my responsibilities for a day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187983
    m_Key: To come into the city with him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187984
    m_Key: But I just can't.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187985
    m_Key: What if something happens while I'm off having fun?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187986
    m_Key: Like today, for example.<pause:0.5> You two showed up out of nowhere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187987
    m_Key: Who would've taken you to the city if I wasn't here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187988
    m_Key: I guess we'd have had to wait until morning and go with your dad.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187989
    m_Key: And waiting is something we really can't afford right now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187990
    m_Key: We've got a loan hanging over our heads, and we need to start paying it
      off as soon as possible.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187991
    m_Key: You've really helped us out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187992
    m_Key: Little fox,<pause:0.5> what's your name?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187993
    m_Key: Red.<pause:0.5> And yours?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187994
    m_Key: I'm Daisy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187995
    m_Key: Nice to meet you, Daisy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187996
    m_Key: Red,<pause:0.5> what's it like living in a city that's even bigger than
      Clifford?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187997
    m_Key: It's... not the safest place.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187998
    m_Key: 'Daisy,<pause: 0.5> why do the people of Riverside dislike Clifford so
      much, <pause:0.5> but still trying to reach there?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095187999
    m_Key: I don't know.<pause:0.5> It's always been a complicated relationship.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095188000
    m_Key: And then there was that whole thing with the new road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095188001
    m_Key: "What happened? (\u0427\u0442\u043E \u0437\u0430 \u0441\u043B\u0443\u0447\u0430\u0439?)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095188002
    m_Key: Not long ago, we found out they're building a road from Clifford to the
      main highway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095188003
    m_Key: We were all excited, thinking it would pass through our village and finally
      give us an easy way into the city.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095188004
    m_Key: But it turned out they're building it through the desert instead of our
      forest to save a little money.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095188005
    m_Key: I don't let anyone see it,<pause:0.5> but<pause:0.5> between you and me,<pause:0.5>
      it really hurt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095188006
    m_Key: If the village had a road and even just one car, I'd worry a lot less.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095188007
    m_Key: I'd know the villagers wouldn't be in danger without me around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095188008
    m_Key: I'm sorry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095188009
    m_Key: If you ever do make it to the city,<pause:0.5> come visit us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095188010
    m_Key: We're opening a restaurant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095188011
    m_Key: We haven't come up with a name yet, but you'll know it when you see it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095188012
    m_Key: It's going to be the coolest place in the world!<pause:0.5> You won't
      be able to miss it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095188013
    m_Key: Wooow,<pause:0.5> that sounds amazing!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095188014
    m_Key: I'd love to!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095188015
    m_Key: And your soup was really delicious!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095188016
    m_Key: I'll definitely stop by if I get the chance!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095188017
    m_Key: It's a deal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095188018
    m_Key: Oh,<pause:0.5> is that the highway with the bus stop?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96172734095188019
    m_Key: Excactly!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525269921792
    m_Key: I have to admit, you two did an excellent job, little foxes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525295087616
    m_Key: The people of Riverside are feeling much better now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525295087617
    m_Key: And maybe now this witch hunt will finally come to an end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525295087618
    m_Key: So you really are a witch after all!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525295087619
    m_Key: I'm about as much of a witch as you are a Leshy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525295087620
    m_Key: I'm a fortune teller,<pause:0.5> and a terrible one at that.<pause:0.5>
      Then again, so are all fortune tellers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525295087621
    m_Key: But to the locals, it's all the same.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525295087622
    m_Key: They'll gladly believe the most unbelievable explanation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525295087623
    m_Key: You distracted me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525295087624
    m_Key: You've both worked hard, and you've earned yourselves a reward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525295087625
    m_Key: I have a bit of influence both here and in Clifford.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525295087626
    m_Key: And I also happen to own quite a few interesting little things.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525295087627
    m_Key: Each of you gets one wish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525295087628
    m_Key: Choose wisely,<pause:0.5> but don't get greedy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525295087629
    m_Key: I want to keep that oven.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525295087630
    m_Key: You don't ask for small favors, do you, Red?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525295087631
    m_Key: But it's a fair price, considering what you've done.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525295087632
    m_Key: Besides, it's been gathering dust here anyway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525295087633
    m_Key: I hate cooking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525295087634
    m_Key: It's yours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525295087635
    m_Key: And what about you, Silver?<pause:0.5> What do you want?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525295087636
    m_Key: I want you to get us to Clifford as soon as possible.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525295087637
    m_Key: t<volume:0>.<pause:0.5>.<pause:0.5>.<pause:0.5><volume:1> Fine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525295087638
    m_Key: We do have a backup plan for emergencies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525295087639
    m_Key: I suppose<pause:0.5> today qualifies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525295087640
    m_Key: But if she comes back complaining that you two gave her a hard time...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525295087641
    m_Key: We'll be perfect gentlemen!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525295087642
    m_Key: That's the right answer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 96391525295087643
    m_Key: Pack your things,<pause:0.5> the next ride to Clifford leaves in ten minutes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_KeyGenerator:
    rid: 4071483982033715328
